Apple LZFSE and LZVN decoders, imported unmodified for the APFS driver
(compressed files, decmpfs types 7, 8, 11 and 12).

Source:  https://github.com/lzfse/lzfse
Commit:  e634ca58b4821d9f3d560cdc6df5dec02ffc93fd (2017-05-22)
License: BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2015-2016 Apple Inc.; see LICENSE.

Only the decoding files are included. They are built as C with NDEBUG
(their assert() checks are compiled out) and are always given a scratch
buffer, so lzfse_decode_buffer() never allocates.
